#!/bin/keymap -l
# HackHaste for Haiku and BeOS (Version 3 text keymap).
# HackHaste keyboard layout. Dr. Marcus Roe, https://drm.cc/ . MIT License.
# Caps Lock scancode 0x3b is LControl. Physical Left Control (0x5c) is CapsLock.
# Shift-lock variants: Caps column equals Shift for every key
# (digits and punctuation too).
# Compile on Haiku: keymap -c < thisfile   then open keymap.out in Keymap.
#
# Raw key numbering copied from Haiku US.keymap.
